<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Synthetic Data Generation</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial; }
  .header-logo { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; }
  .content-box { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 20px; margin-top: 20px; }
  .step-instruction { margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .note { background-color: #f0f0f0; padding: 15px; border-left: 5px solid #0056b3; margin-top: 20px; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  th, td { border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  th { background-color: #f2f2f2; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
        <div class="header-logo">University of New Hampshire</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Learn for Life</div>
    </div>

    <h2 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">HOW TO PAY THE OUTSTANDING BALANCE IN A STUDENT ACCOUNT:</h2>

    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>1.</strong> Log In to the <a href="#" style="color: #0056b3;">learnforlife.unh.edu</a> website using the Student Login in the upper right corner:</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Placeholder for Screenshot 1 -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_screenshot_1.png" alt="Screenshot 1" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>2.</strong> Use the "<span data-field="account_status">{{ account_status }}</span>" log in, using the student user name and password that you were assigned when initially creating the student account, or whatever you may have changed them to.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="note">
        <strong>NOTE:</strong> These are case sensitive.
    </div>

    <!-- Placeholder for Screenshot 2 -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_screenshot_2.png" alt="Screenshot 2" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>3.</strong> This will bring you to "<span data-field="screen_name">{{ screen_name }}</span>" screen:</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Placeholder for Screenshot 3 -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_screenshot_3.png" alt="Screenshot 3" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>

    <div class="step-instruction" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p><strong>4.</strong> Click on '<span data-field="menu_item_name">{{ menu_item_name }}</span>.'</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>5.</strong> To choose which invoice to pay, click the box to the left of the invoice.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>6.</strong> Click on '<span data-field="button_name">{{ button_name }}</span>.'</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Placeholder for Screenshot 4 -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_screenshot_4.png" alt="Screenshot 4" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>

    <div class="note" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <strong>Notes:</strong>
        <ul>
            <li>The last column shows the Balance Due for that particular basket/cart.</li>
            <li>If you have registered a child for more than one camp, then you may have numerous basket #'s on this screen. Clicking on the Basket # will allow you to see the details so that you can choose which program to pay the balance for.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>7.</strong> Review and click the box that you have read the registration and privacy policies.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>8.</strong> Click 'Continue Checkout.'</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Placeholder for Screenshot 5 -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_screenshot_5.png" alt="Screenshot 5" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="step-instruction">
        <p><strong>9.</strong> Review the Payment Information, and click on 'Continue.' (Or click 'Cancel' if you are not ready to pay at time).</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Placeholder for Screenshot 6 -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_screenshot_6.png" alt="Screenshot 6" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>

    <div class="step-instruction" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p><strong>10.</strong> Input credit card and billing address information.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Placeholder for Screenshot 7 -->
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
        <img src="placeholder_screenshot_7.png" alt="Screenshot 7" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
    </div>

    <div class="step-instruction" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        <p><strong>11.</strong> After entering all required data, click on 'Continue' to complete the payment process.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="note" style="margin-top: 30px;">
        You will receive an email confirmation of your payment from the payment processor. This confirmation will go to the email provided in the student account.
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>